{"name": "Pizzapocalypse 2", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pizzapocalypse 2</strong> is a 3D platformer with a pizza moveset that's fun for all skill levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extras/b11e2f1bba347c32712ad2ecf647f2f1.poster.avif?t=1786526034\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extras/b11e2f1bba347c32712ad2ecf647f2f1.webm?t=1786526034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extras/b11e2f1bba347c32712ad2ecf647f2f1.mp4?t=1786526034\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Take down Pizza Corp</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PizzaCorp\u00a0</strong>has greedily taken over the world with its robots &amp; product: <strong>Pizza-In-A-Can</strong>. It might name its robots <strong>P.A.L.S</strong>, but they're more dangerous than they might seem! <br/>Take down this greedy corporation to bring back hope to the world, <strong>one slice at a time</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extras/bcbee5879272262ad9209b6041f0e1d5.poster.avif?t=1786526034\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extras/bcbee5879272262ad9209b6041f0e1d5.webm?t=1786526034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extras/bcbee5879272262ad9209b6041f0e1d5.mp4?t=1786526034\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your moves, your style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play your own way</strong>. Whether it's collecting everything, <strong>mastering your moves</strong> to improve times, or <strong>finding secrets</strong>!<br/>Use your <strong>pizza</strong> to bounce, dash &amp; swing your way through <strong>different countries</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extras/a54d455a4a0ba75245e09d0db1051446.poster.avif?t=1786526034\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extras/a54d455a4a0ba75245e09d0db1051446.webm?t=1786526034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extras/a54d455a4a0ba75245e09d0db1051446.mp4?t=1786526034\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect, customize, discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your adventures you can find <strong>new</strong>\u00a0<strong>outfits, pizzas </strong>and <strong>bonus levels!</strong>\u00a0<br/>The cities you explore are full of secrets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extras/3b979c681c13ea1e21e67acaaa11e797.poster.avif?t=1786526034\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021890/extra